      "listing": {
        "title": "Appstore",
        "description": "Appstore is an open-source Android app store that scans six sources and merges them into one feed: GitHub, GitLab, F-Droid, IzzyOnDroid, APKPure and Aptoide. No ads and no bloat.\n\nFind what you want faster\n- Browse curated categories plus smart sections such as Trending and Newly Launched.\n- See screenshots pulled straight from each project's README.\n- Sync your GitHub starred repositories into your favourites.\n\nInstall with confidence\n- Every downloaded APK is checked against the signing certificate of the app already on your phone before it installs, so a hijacked repository or redirected release cannot silently replace what you have.\n- Your install history is kept, and you can roll back to a previous version from it.\n\nMade for everyone\n- Available in 16 languages, including English, Hindi, Spanish, French, German, Japanese, Portuguese, Arabic and Chinese.\n- Dismissible in-app announcements for releases and community updates.\n- Optional Liquid Glass Pro themes.\n\nAppstore is open source under the AGPL-3.0 licence.",
