      "listing": {
        "title": "Echo Music",
        "description": "Echo Music delivers a seamless, premium listening experience built on YouTube Music's vast library, without the ads. It adds powerful extras including offline downloads, real-time synchronized lyrics, and environment-aware music recognition.\n\nFeatures:\n- Ad-Free: stream without any interruptions\n- Seamless Playback: switch effortlessly between audio-only and video modes\n- Background Playback: listen while using other apps or with the screen off\n- Offline Mode: download tracks, albums and playlists through a dedicated download manager\n- Echo Find: identify songs playing around you using advanced audio recognition\n- Multiple Lyric Animations: word-by-word synchronized display styles\n- Smart Recommendations: personalized suggestions based on your listening history\n- Echo Brain: an intelligent, on-device engine that analyzes your taste locally\n- Material You and Liquid Glass themes that adapt to your wallpaper\n- Light, Dark and AMOLED modes\n\nYour listening history stays on your device. Echo Music never phones home with what you play.",
